// Local, machine-specific build settings. NOT tracked by git.
//
// Copy this file to `Local.xcconfig` and fill in your own values, then run
// `xcodegen generate`. `Local.xcconfig` is git-ignored so a personal Apple
// Developer Team ID never reaches a commit — this repository is mirrored to
// the public `nowthis-source` repository, and project.yml goes with it.
//
//     cp Local.xcconfig.template Local.xcconfig
//
// Leaving DEVELOPMENT_TEAM empty is supported: Xcode falls back to manual
// team selection in Signing & Capabilities, which is what a contributor
// building for their own device wants anyway.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID_HERE
